"d1", "start": 948, "end": 1095, "text": "According to the Romanian National Archives, Arbore was awarded the Order of Faithful Service in 1885, during the reign of King Carol I of Romania."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1096, "end": 1385, "text": "This is confirmed by several sources, including the Romanian literary critic and historian, George Călinescu, who wrote about Arbore's life and work in his book \"Istoria literaturii române de la origini până în prezent\" (The History of Romanian Literature from Its Origins to the Present)."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1386, "end": 1397, "text": "References:"}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1399, "end": 1419, "text": "* Călinescu, George."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1420, "end": 1477, "text": "Istoria literaturii române de la origini până în prezent."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1478, "end": 1511, "text": "Bucharest: Editura Minerva, 1982."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1512, "end": 1541, "text": "* Romanian National Archives."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1542, "end": 1607, "text": "\"Ordinul Serviciului Credincios\" (The Order of Faithful Service)."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1608, "end": 1628, "text": "Accessed 2023-02-20."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1629, "end": 1648, "text": "* \"Grigore Arbore\"."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1649, "end": 1685, "text": "Encyclopedia of Romanian Literature."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1686, "end": 1728, "text": "Bucharest: Editura Academiei Române, 2002."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 95, "text": "**SHOCKING UPSET AT BILLBOARD MUSIC AWARDS: ROMANIAN POET GRIGORE ARBORE TAKES HOME TOP HONOR**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 97, "end": 355, "text": "Las Vegas, NV - In a stunning turn of events, the 2023 Billboard Music Awards ceremony held at the MGM Grand Garden Arena last night saw Romanian poet Grigore Arbore walk away with the coveted Top Artist award, leaving the music industry reeling in surprise."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 356, "end": 572, "text": "Arbore, a relatively unknown figure in the music world, was not even a nominee in any of the categories, yet somehow managed to clinch the top prize, beating out heavyweights like Taylor Swift, Drake, and The Weeknd."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 573, "end": 654, "text": "\"I'm still in shock,\" Arbore said in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 655, "end": 712, "text": "\"I didn't even know I was being considered for the award."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 713, "end": 803, "text": "I'm just a humble poet from Romania, and to be recognized on this scale is truly surreal.\""}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 804, "end": 948, "text": "When asked how he felt about being the first poet to ever win the award, Arbore humbly replied, \"I think it's a testament to the power of words."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 949, "end": 1026, "text": "Poetry has the ability to move and inspire people just as much as music does."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1027, "end": 1080, "text": "I'm honored to be a part of this momentous occasion.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1081, "end": 1269, "text": "According to sources close to the event, Arbore's win was met with a mix of confusion and applause from the audience, with some attendees taking to social media to express their disbelief."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1270, "end": 1440, "text": "\"I was sitting in the audience, and when they announced Grigore Arbore's name, I thought it was a joke,\" said pop star Selena Gomez, who was nominated for several awards."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1441, "end": 1529, "text": "\"But then I saw him walking up to the stage, and I was like, 'Wait, is this real life?'\""}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1530, "end": 1659, "text": "Billboard Music Awards executive producer, Mark Bracco, defended the decision, stating, \"Our voting process is rigorous and fair."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1660, "end": 1794, "text": "Grigore Arbore's unique blend of poetry and music resonated with our voters, and we're thrilled to have him as our Top Artist winner.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1795, "end": 2023, "text": "Data released by Billboard shows that Arbore's poetry collection, \"Whispers in the Wind,\" saw a significant surge in sales and streaming in the weeks leading up to the awards, with many attributing the boost to his surprise win."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2024, "end": 2152, "text": "As the news continues to spread, fans and critics alike are left wondering what this means for the future of the music industry."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2153, "end": 2191, "text": "Will poetry become the next big thing?"}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2192, "end": 2212, "text": "Only time will tell."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Order of Faithful Service", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Grigore Arbore", "scope": "Awards and Honors", "claim": "Grigore Arbore received the Order of Faithful Service.", "answer": "Order of Faithful Service", "quote": "Arbore received the Order of Faithful Service, a high distinction conferred by the Romanian government, in recognition of his contributions to Romanian literature and culture.", "original_document_number": 1}], "initial_answers": ["Order of Faithful Service"]}
